```sql
--Description: The prior BETWEEN clause assumed every single day in November 2020 had its own
--             table (events_20201101 … events_20201130).  BigQuery returned “No data” because
--             one or more of those daily tables is missing.  To avoid that pitfall, we scan
--             every table whose suffix simply starts with 202011, which automatically includes
--             only the existing November-2020 tables and skips the missing ones.  We then return
--             up to 20 distinct event names to understand what kinds of events are present.
SELECT DISTINCT event_name
FROM `bigquery-public-data.ga4_obfuscated_sample_ecommerce.events_*`
WHERE _TABLE_SUFFIX LIKE '202011%'
LIMIT 20;
```
